writeTextAtomic(resolve(ROOT,"GLOBAL-CITATION-NORMALISATION-DIFF.md"),`# Global Citation Normalisation\n\nApplied ${GENERATED_AT}.\n\n- Replaced model-authored OSCOLA strings and repeated access dates with \`{{cite:source_id}}\` tokens.\n- Added deterministic rendering metadata: author, exact title, pinpoint, accessed-at date, canonical URL hash and snapshot hash.\n- Corrected titles to \`Avoid and report pension scams\`, \`FCA Firm Checker\`, \`Pensions glossary: A-Z guide to retirement terms\`, and \`Pension investment options\`.\n- Kept internal policy sources non-user-visible.\n- Added visible handoff destinations to every \`handoff_required\` answer.\n- Replaced the single scam paragraph with four response structures: stop/protect/verify; refuse/recovery; explain/independent check; account-compromise response.\n- No evaluation question, gold answer, gold chunk or sealed unseen asset was added to training.\n`);
